[Strings]
\s\sMB = \s\sMB
\sType of object determination, lowering Max its or increasing DE\n(dependend on the choosen option), will make the object thicker.\nNote:  DEcombinate formulas work only in the Distance estimation mode! = \s物件判定方式；降低 Max its 或提高 DE\n（取決於所選的選項）會使物件變厚。\n注意：DEcombinate 公式僅在距離估算模式下有效！
&Basic colors: = 基本顏色(&B)：
&Open = 開啟(&O)
&Save = 儲存(&S)
&Select = 選取(&S)
..til next update = ..距下次更新
1:  Full size, no anti aliasing\n2:  2x2 anti aliasing\n3:  3x3 anti aliasing = 1:  原尺寸，無反鋸齒\n2:  2x2 反鋸齒\n3:  3x3 反鋸齒
1:  none\n2:  2x2\n3:  3x3 = 1:  無\n2:  2x2\n3:  3x3
Abort = 中止
Absolute distance of the smooth combine functions,\nyou can use scientific notation like 3e-5 for small values.\nTry 1/zoom to get close to a working value. = 平滑合併函數的絕對距離，\n小數值可使用科學記號，例如 3e-5。\n可嘗試 1/zoom 來接近可用的值。
All files (*.*) = 所有檔案 (*.*)
Box: sharp, good AA\nGauss: bit blurry, very good AA = Box：銳利，AA 良好\nGauss：略為模糊，AA 極佳
Calculate 3D = 計算 3D
Calculate preview = 計算預覽
Calculate the image first. = 請先計算影像。
Calculated on the CPU = 在 CPU 上計算
Calculated on: {} = 計算於：{}
Cancel = 取消
Cannot write {}: {} = 無法寫入 {}：{}
Click a parameter file for its preview. = 按一下參數檔案即可預覽。
Click on image = 按一下影像
Co: = Co:
Code: {}\nFile: {} = 代碼：{}\n檔案：{}
Color = 顏色
Color Option:\n0:  Average of both formulas.\n1:  Color of first formula.\n2:  Color of second formula. = 顏色選項：\n0:  兩個公式的平均。\n1:  第一個公式的顏色。\n2:  第二個公式的顏色。
Combination Methods:\nMin: Both fractals are visible, minimum combine the DE's\nMax: Only overlapping parts, maximum combine the DE's\nInv max: Invert DE of second Hybrid and combine 'Max'\nMin lin: Minimum combine with a linear overlap function\nMin nlin: Like S1, nonlinear function, more smooth overlap\nMix: First F1..FendHybrid1 then use FstartHybrid2..F6 (dIFS) with modified vector. = 合併方法：\nMin：兩個分形皆可見，以 DE 的最小值合併\nMax：僅顯示重疊部分，以 DE 的最大值合併\nInv max：反轉第二個 Hybrid 的 DE 後以「Max」合併\nMin lin：以線性重疊函數取最小值合併\nMin nlin：類似 S1，使用非線性函數，重疊更平滑\nMix：先用 F1..FendHybrid1，再以修改後的向量使用 FstartHybrid2..F6 (dIFS)。
Defines how accurate the position with the defined distance to the surface will be calculated.\nHigher values leads to more accuracy what leads also to a better normals calculation.\nMuch more than 12 are rarely needed. = 定義計算距表面指定距離之位置時的精確程度。\n數值越高越精確，法線的計算也會更好。\n很少需要遠超過 12 的值。
Depth of reflections: 1 to see only one reflection,\nwith 2 you could see reflections in the reflected object, ... and so on. = 反射深度：1 只會看到一次反射，\n2 則可在被反射的物件中看到反射，…依此類推。
Divides the actual "Raystep multiplier" by this value,\nincrease the value to reduce overstepping. = 將實際的「Raystep multiplier」除以此值，\n提高此值可減少步進過大的情形。
Ds: = Ds：
Dyn. fog on It.: = 依迭代動態霧：
Dynamic fog:\nThe lower the number the farer away from the object the fog shows up.\nWith dIFS, the fog is around the object part calculated at this iteration.\nZero to disable this feature and do the dynamic fog on raystep count as usual.\nHint: Check the 'First step random' option to prevent steps.\nVolumetric light:\nChoose the light nr from which lightscattering will be calculated. = 動態霧：\n數值越低，霧出現的位置離物件越遠。\n使用 dIFS 時，霧圍繞在此迭代所計算的物件部分周圍。\n設為零可停用此功能，並照常依光線步數計算動態霧。\n提示：勾選「First step random」選項可避免階梯狀條紋。\n體積光：\n選擇要計算光散射的光源編號。
